# Assets are not distributed with this repo - they belong to the game's
# copyright holders. Run PoinpyDecompiler.csx against your own copy of
# game.droid to regenerate everything below.

# Sprite frames and layers
sprites/*/*.png
sprites/*/layers/*/*.png


# Audio
sounds/*/*.ogg
sounds/*/*.wav
sounds/*/*.mp3

# Font textures
fonts/*/*.png

# Included files (localisation, splash images, native libs)
datafiles/

# The build needs these to exist. The splash is a blank black 320x240 image and
# the icon is a neutral placeholder - neither is game artwork, so both ship.
# Replace them with your own if you make a build.

# GameMaker local state
*.resource_order
.gm/
Configs/
temp/
